#174693=PRODUCT('PRT - 9040 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'PRT - 9040 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'Beam target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense, chassis: slides into an open
UC2 cube, two rigid rails on -x seat on the 45 deg edge chamfers (x, z
); two long flexure arms on +x click into the +x chamfers, two lands o
n -x limit the roll, the stick''s shoulder is the hard stop. Camera bl
ock in a square seat, XIAO from the back, USB-C from the top. PETG, pr
int on the front face, no supports.',(#174688));
#174694=PRODUCT('PRT - 9041 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'PRT - 9041 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'Back cover: slides down in the dovetail, tongues press the XIAO forwa
rd, the slits are the vents. One M3 x 10 into a Ruthex insert. Print o
n the back face.',(#174688));
#174695=PRODUCT('PRT - 9033 - CAMTARKEY - V04',
'PRT - 9033 - CAMTARKEY - V04',
'Wedge key: pushed in from the side between the camera module and the 
USB-C shell, clamps the module into its seat. Print on its side.',(#174688));
#174696=PRODUCT('PRT - 9034 - CAMTARSCR - V04',
'PRT - 9034 - CAMTARSCR - V04',
'Screen cap: 0.6 mm printed white screen with a reticle on the inner f
ace, cone-centred, two 8x3 magnets. Print on the screen, white.',(#174688));
